# E-Business: Higher Education and Intelligence Applications

**Authors:** Wu, Robert M. X., Ed.

## Abstract
This book provides the latest viewpoints of scientific research in the field of e-business. It is organized into three sections: &quot;Higher Education and Digital Economy Development&quot;, &quot;Artificial Intelligence in E-Business&quot;, and &quot;Business Intelligence Applications&quot;. Chapters focus on China's higher education in e-commerce, digital economy development, natural language processing applications in business, Information Technology Governance, Risk and Compliance (IT GRC), business intelligence, and more. [Co-edited by Marinela Mircea.]

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED614760

